  "aliases": [],
  "summary": "列表多选后底部浮出操作栏「已选 3 项 · 删除 / 移动 / 取消」；勾选数变化时数字滚动，点取消清空并收起。",
  "usage": "任务列表、邮件列表、文件管理这类需要批量删除 / 移动 / 归档的列表页。",
  "caution": "列表只有 2–3 项时没必要做批量栏；危险操作（删除）要二次确认，别一键就删。",
  "hint": "点几行勾选，底部浮出操作栏；点取消清空",
  "inspiration": "",
  "prompt": "【批量操作栏】目标：列表勾选进入多选态后，底部浮出一条操作栏「已选 3 项 · 删除 / 移动 / 取消」；勾选数变化时数字滚动一下；点取消退出多选、操作栏自动收起；没选中时不显示操作栏。\n\n1) 结构：.wrap 是 `position:absolute; inset:0` 的纵向 flex（列表 + 绝对定位的 .bar）；.bar 用 `position:absolute; left:12px; right:12px; bottom:10px` 浮在列表底部上方，不占列表高度。\n2) 选中态：列表行 .item 加 .sel 时底色 `color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 8%,transparent)`；左侧 .cb 从描边圆角方框变成主色填充 + SVG 对勾（`<path d=\"M5.5 12.5l4.2 4.1 8.8-9.6\"/>`，stroke 2.8、round cap/join，不要用字符 ✓）。\n3) 操作栏出现/收起：默认 `opacity:0; transform:translateY(10px); pointer-events:none`，`.bar.show` 时 `opacity:1; transform:none; pointer-events:auto`；过渡 `opacity .22s ease, transform .26s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.25,1)`。\n4) 数字滚动：count 变化时给 `.num` 重新触发 `@keyframes numIn{from{transform:translateY(7px);opacity:0}to{transform:none;opacity:1}}`（220ms）；重新触发前要 `classList.remove` + `void el.offsetWidth` 强制回流，否则连续变化时动画不重放。\n5) 布局：列表用 `flex:1; min-height:0; overflow:hidden`，底部留 `padding-bottom`（卡片 48px / 弹窗 78px）避免最后一行被操作栏盖住；操作栏左「N 项已选」、右侧按钮组（删除 danger 色、移动普通、取消 ghost）。\n6) 交互：点整行切换选中（不只是勾选框）；点取消清空选中并收起操作栏；弹窗初始显示已选 3 项（目标态）。\n7) 演示（卡片预览自动播）：依次点第 1/2/3 行（每步 520ms 移动 + 190ms 按下松开）→ 数字从 1 滚到 3 → 停约 0.5 秒 → 点「取消」清空收起 → 循环；每轮先清空状态。\n8) 无障碍：操作栏 `role=\"toolbar\"` + aria-label；按钮用原生 button；勾选态只用颜色+图形区分时，行本身保留可点击语义。\n9) 坑：①操作栏绝对定位但列表要留 padding-bottom，否则最后一项被压住；②数字滚动必须强制回流重放动画；③bar 隐藏时 pointer-events:none，否则会挡住列表最后一行点击；④选中数用「选中项计数」而不是数组长度，避免重复切换后计数错；⑤删除是危险操作，按钮用 danger 色但不要用红色填充大面积，一个描边红字就够；⑥清空选中要同时移除所有 .sel，别只改计数。\n10) 配色：选中底主色 8% 透明、勾选框主色填充 + 反色对勾、删除按钮 --ui-danger、操作栏底 surface 混 3% 文字色 + 低对比边框 + 阴影。\n11) 使用场景：任务列表、邮件列表、文件管理这类需要批量删除/移动/归档的列表页；移动端底部操作栏，桌面端也可以吸顶。",
  "demoHtml": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{height:100%}\nbody{margin:0;overflow:hidden;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ui-text);background:var(--ui-bg)}\n\n.wrap{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:10px 12px 0}\n.list{flex:1;min-height:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;overflow:hidden;padding-bottom:48px}\n.item{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;\n  transition:background-color .16s ease}\n.item:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 4%,transparent)}\n.item.sel{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 8%,transparent)}\n.cb{flex:0 0 auto;width:13px;height:13px;border-radius:4px;display:grid;place-items:center;\n  border:1.5px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 28%,transparent);color:var(--ui-bg);\n  transition:background-color .16s ease,border-color .16s ease}\n.item.sel .cb{background:var(--ui-brand);border-color:var(--ui-brand)}\n.cb svg{display:block;width:8px;height:8px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.8;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;opacity:0;transition:opacity .14s ease}\n.item.sel .cb svg{opacity:1}\n.i-main{flex:1;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1px}\n.i-main b{font-size:9px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n.i-main span{font-size:7.5px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n.i-val{flex:0 0 auto;font-size:7.5px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);white-space:nowrap}\n\n/* 批量操作栏：底部浮出 */\n.bar{position:absolute;left:12px;right:12px;bottom:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\n  padding:7px 9px 7px 11px;border-radius:11px;\n  border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 14%,transparent);\n  background:var(--ui-surface);\n  background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 3%,var(--ui-surface));\n  box-shadow:0 10px 24px color-mix(in srgb,#000 14%,transparent);\n  opacity:0;transform:translateY(10px);pointer-events:none;\n  transition:opacity .22s ease,transform .26s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.25,1)}\n.bar.show{opacity:1;transform:none;pointer-events:auto}\n.count{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:3px;font-size:9px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);white-space:nowrap}\n.num{display:inline-block;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ui-text);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.num.roll{animation:numIn .22s ease}\n@keyframes numIn{from{transform:translateY(7px);opacity:0}to{transform:none;opacity:1}}\n.acts{margin-left:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px}\n.act{flex:0 0 auto;height:21px;padding:0 9px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 16%,transparent);\n  background:transparent;color:var(--ui-text);font:inherit;font-size:8.5px;font-weight:500;cursor:pointer;\n  transition:transform .12s ease,background-color .15s ease,border-color .15s ease}\n.act:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 6%,transparent)}\n.act.danger{color:var(--ui-danger);border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-danger) 35%,transparent)}\n.act.danger:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-danger) 9%,transparent)}\n.act.ghost{border-color:transparent;color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n.act.pressing,.act:active{transform:scale(.95)}\n\n@media (min-height:421px){\n  .wrap{padding:20px 24px 0}\n  .list{gap:4px;padding-bottom:78px}\n  .item{gap:14px;padding:11px 14px;border-radius:12px}\n  .cb{width:21px;height:21px;border-radius:6px}\n  .cb svg{width:13px;height:13px}\n  .i-main{gap:2px}\n  .i-main b{font-size:15px}\n  .i-main span{font-size:12px}\n  .i-val{font-size:12px}\n  .bar{left:24px;right:24px;bottom:20px;gap:14px;padding:12px 16px 12px 18px;border-radius:16px}\n  .count{font-size:14px;gap:5px}\n  .num{font-size:16px}\n  .acts{gap:9px}\n  .act{height:32px;padding:0 15px;font-size:13px;border-radius:8px}\n}\n@media (max-height:420px){\n  .wrap{padding:8px 10px 0}\n  .list{gap:1px;padding-bottom:40px}\n  .item{gap:7px;padding:4px 6px;border-radius:7px}\n  .cb{width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:3px}\n  .cb svg{width:7px;height:7px}\n  .i-main b{font-size:8.5px}\n  .i-main span{font-size:7px}\n  .i-val{font-size:7px}\n  .bar{left:10px;right:10px;bottom:8px;gap:6px;padding:5px 7px 5px 9px;border-radius:9px}\n  .count{font-size:8px}\n  .num{font-size:9px}\n  .acts{gap:4px}\n  .act{height:19px;padding:0 7px;font-size:8px;border-radius:5px}\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n  .item,.bar,.num,.act,.cb svg{transition:none}\n  .num.roll{animation:none}\n}\n</style></head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"list\" id=\"list\">\n    <div class=\"item\" data-i=\"0\">\n      <span class=\"cb\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M5.5 12.5l4.2 4.1 8.8-9.6\"/></svg></span>\n      <div class=\"i-main\"><b>产品评审会</b><span>今天 10:00 · 3 人</span></div>\n      <span class=\"i-val\">待定</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"item\" data-i=\"1\">\n      <span class=\"cb\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M5.5 12.5l4.2 4.1 8.8-9.6\"/></svg></span>\n      <div class=\"i-main\"><b>设计稿走查</b><span>今天 14:30 · 林舟</span></div>\n      <span class=\"i-val\">进行中</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"item\" data-i=\"2\">\n      <span class=\"cb\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M5.5 12.5l4.2 4.1 8.8-9.6\"/></svg></span>\n      <div class=\"i-main\"><b>配色方案对齐</b><span>明天 · 我</span></div>\n      <span class=\"i-val\">待办</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"item\" data-i=\"3\">\n      <span class=\"cb\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M5.5 12.5l4.2 4.1 8.8-9.6\"/></svg></span>\n      <div class=\"i-main\"><b>发布检查清单</b><span>周五 · 团队</span></div>\n      <span class=\"i-val\">待办</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"bar\" id=\"bar\" role=\"toolbar\" aria-label=\"批量操作\">\n    <span class=\"count\"><span class=\"num\" id=\"num\">3</span> 项已选</span>\n    <div class=\"acts\">\n      <button class=\"act danger\" id=\"delBtn\" type=\"button\">删除</button>\n      <button class=\"act\" id=\"moveBtn\" type=\"button\">移动</button>\n      <button class=\"act ghost\" id=\"cancelBtn\" type=\"button\">取消</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var list = document.getElementById('list'),\n      items = [].slice.call(list.querySelectorAll('.item')),\n      bar = document.getElementById('bar'),\n      num = document.getElementById('num'),\n      cancelBtn = document.getElementById('cancelBtn');\n\n  var sel = {}, count = 0;\n  var timers = [], cursor = null, cursorReady = false;\n\n  function later(fn, ms){ timers.push(setTimeout(fn, ms)); }\n  function clearTimers(){ for(var i = 0; i < timers.length; i++) clearTimeout(timers[i]); timers = []; }\n  function ensureCursor(){\n    if(cursorReady) return cursor;\n    cursorReady = true;\n    if(!window.__uiInteractive && typeof window.__uiDemoCursor === 'function'){\n      cursor = window.__uiDemoCursor();\n      setTimeout(function(){ if(cursor && typeof cursor.hide === 'function') cursor.hide(); }, 120);\n    }\n    return cursor;\n  }\n  function showCursor(){ if(cursor && cursor.el) cursor.el.classList.add('show'); }\n\n  function setCount(n){\n    var changed = n !== count;\n    count = n;\n    num.textContent = n;\n    bar.classList.toggle('show', n > 0);\n    if(changed){\n      num.classList.remove('roll');\n      void num.offsetWidth;\n      num.classList.add('roll');\n    }\n  }\n\n  function toggle(i){\n    sel[i] = !sel[i];\n    items[i].classList.toggle('sel', !!sel[i]);\n    setCount(Object.keys(sel).filter(function(k){ return sel[k]; }).length);\n  }\n\n  function clearSel(){\n    sel = {};\n    for(var i = 0; i < items.length; i++) items[i].classList.remove('sel');\n    setCount(0);\n  }\n\n  for(var i = 0; i < items.length; i++){\n    (function(n){\n      items[n].addEventListener('click', function(){ toggle(n); });\n    })(i);\n  }\n  cancelBtn.addEventListener('click', clearSel);\n\n  function tap(el, done){\n    if(!cursor){ done && done(); return; }\n    showCursor();\n    cursor.moveTo(el);\n    later(function(){\n      cursor.press();\n      el.classList.add('pressing');\n      later(function(){\n        cursor.release();\n        el.classList.remove('pressing');\n        done && done();\n      }, 190);\n    }, 520);\n  }\n\n  function demoCycle(){\n    clearTimers();\n    clearSel();\n    ensureCursor();\n    if(cursor && typeof cursor.hide === 'function') cursor.hide();\n    var steps = [0, 1, 2];\n    for(var i = 0; i < steps.length; i++){\n      (function(idx, delay){\n        later(function(){ tap(items[idx], function(){ toggle(idx); }); }, delay);\n      })(steps[i], 400 + i * 850);\n    }\n    later(function(){ tap(cancelBtn, clearSel); }, 3300);\n    later(function(){ if(typeof cursor.hide === 'function') cursor.hide(); }, 4200);\n    later(demoCycle, 4800);\n  }\n\n  if(window.__uiInteractive){\n    /* 弹窗初始态：已选 3 项（目标态） */\n    sel = {0: true, 1: true, 2: true};\n    for(var i = 0; i < items.length; i++) items[i].classList.toggle('sel', !!sel[i]);\n    setCount(3);\n  } else {\n    setTimeout(demoCycle, 300);\n  }\n})();\n</script>\n</body></html>",
